{"findings": [{"file": "src/sentry/api/endpoints/organization_auditlogs.py", "line": 76, "severity": "high", "category": "bug", "title": "Unrelated audit log pagination changes break on datetime ordering and unknown `paginate` argument", "body": "`OrganizationAuditLogsEndpoint.get` appears to contain unrelated changes for `OptimizedCursorPaginator` that will fail at runtime when `optimized_pagination=true` is passed by a superuser or global-access member:

